          "info": "Only used when \"Pick groups are\" is set to Tabs, e.g. \"Perfumes\" or \"Attar Roll-Ons\". Blank falls back to the heading above."
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "tab_image",
          "label": "Tab button image",
