          "default": "exact",
          "label": "How many items",
          "info": "\"Exactly this many\" is the classic offer picker (\"choose any 3\"). \"Any quantity in a range\" lets the customer set the quantity themselves — used by the duo page, where the price follows the quantities picked. Pair it with a Discount above, otherwise every quantity costs the same fixed bundle price."
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "pick_count",
          "label": "Items to pick",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 10,
          "step": 1,
          "default": 2,
          "info": "Used when \"How many items\" is set to \"Exactly this many\"."
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "min_pick",
          "label": "Minimum quantity",
